Description: Per-application volume control with hotkeys
 SoundLowerer Plus is a cross-platform application that automatically
 lowers the volume of specific applications using keyboard shortcuts.
 Features include hold/toggle modes, smooth fade transitions, whitelist
 mode, multiple service profiles, and system tray integration.
 .
 Works with PulseAudio and PipeWire on Linux.
